<NPR>NOTE:  The Energy Policy Act of 2005 and UFC 1-200-02 require new buildings to use 30 percent less energy than 
the<MET> ASHRAE 90.1 - SI</MET><ENG> ASHRAE 90.1 - IP</ENG> baseline.</NPR><BRK/>
