drawings accompanied with complete manufacturer's descriptive information shall be submitted for approval as specified in Section <SRF>23 03 00</SRF> BASIC 
MECHANICAL MATERIALS AND METHODS. Drawing size shall be<MET> 841 by 594 mm</MET><ENG> 34 by 22 inches</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
